title Payments and ledger
direction down

Merchant [icon: store]
Cardholder [icon: credit-card]

Payments platform [icon: wallet, color: green] {
  API [icon: api, description: Public REST API]
  Payment orchestrator [icon: workflow]
  Risk engine [icon: shield, color: red]
  Routing [icon: split]
  Processors [color: gray] {
    Stripe [icon: stripe]
    Adyen [icon: credit-card]
    PayPal [icon: paypal]
  }
  Ledger [icon: book, color: blue] {
    Journal [icon: table, description: double-entry]
    Balances [icon: scale]
    Reconciliation [icon: check]
  }
  Webhooks [icon: webhook]
}
Bank settlement files [icon: bank]
Finance team [icon: users]

legend [position: bottom-right] {
  [connection: >, label: Synchronous call]
  [connection: -->, label: Async event]
  [color: red, label: Risk control]
}

Cardholder > Merchant: checkout
Merchant > API: create payment
API > Payment orchestrator
Payment orchestrator > Risk engine: score
Payment orchestrator > Routing > Stripe, Adyen, PayPal
Stripe, Adyen, PayPal --> Payment orchestrator: result
Payment orchestrator --> Journal: posted
Journal > Balances
Bank settlement files > Reconciliation
Reconciliation <> Journal
Payment orchestrator --> Webhooks > Merchant
Finance team > Reconciliation: reviews
